{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573","id":115718104,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMTU3MTgxMDQ=","number":573,"title":"empty file in {new_,}http_archive results in no caching across Bazel server restarts","user":{"login":"bsilver8192","id":2999225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTkyMjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2999225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192","html_url":"https://github.com/bsilver8192","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106503259,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY1MDMyNTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":192364170,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTIzNjQxNzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"e99695","default":false,"description":"We'll consider working on this in future. (Assignee optional)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"kchodorow","id":17042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow","html_url":"https://github.com/kchodorow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"kchodorow","id":17042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow","html_url":"https://github.com/kchodorow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2015-11-08T08:40:31Z","updated_at":"2015-11-26T00:26:06Z","closed_at":"2015-11-26T00:26:06Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Any actions with empty files from a new_http_archive etc get rebuilt every time the Bazel server is restarted because the files get re-extracted which changes their timestamps, which is what [ActionMetadataHandler](https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/blob/master/src/main/java/com/google/devtools/build/lib/skyframe/ActionMetadataHandler.java) uses to check if empty files have changed. It's not a problem for non-empty files because changes in those are identified using a hash of the file contents.\n\nIn my particular case (files in Linaro GCC tarballs which don't seem to do anything useful), removing the files as inputs is an easy workaround. However, that might be a problem in some cases and it's really hard to figure out what the problem is.\n\nHere's a patch which adds a failing test (please do commit it along with a fix):\n\n``` patch\ndiff --git a/src/test/shell/bazel/external_integration_test.sh b/src/test/shell/bazel/external_integration_test.sh\nindex 6421d81..122369e 100755\n--- a/src/test/shell/bazel/external_integration_test.sh\n+++ b/src/test/shell/bazel/external_integration_test.sh\n@@ -639,4 +639,39 @@ EOF\n   assert_contains \"def\" bazel-genfiles/external/x/catter.out\n }\n\n+function test_empty_file() {\n+  rm -f empty\n+  touch empty\n+  tar czf x.tar.gz empty\n+  local sha256=$(sha256sum x.tar.gz | cut -f 1 -d ' ')\n+  serve_file x.tar.gz\n+\n+  cat > WORKSPACE <<EOF\n+new_http_archive(\n+    name = \"x\",\n+    url = \"http://localhost:$nc_port/x.tar.gz\",\n+    sha256 = \"$sha256\",\n+    build_file = \"x.BUILD\",\n+)\n+EOF\n+  cat > x.BUILD <<EOF\n+exports_files([\"empty\"])\n+EOF\n+  cat > BUILD <<'EOF'\n+genrule(\n+  name = \"rule\",\n+  srcs = [\"@x//:empty\"],\n+  outs = [\"timestamp\"],\n+  cmd = \"date > $@\",\n+)\n+EOF\n+\n+  bazel build //:rule || fail \"Build failed\"\n+  bazel shutdown || fail \"Shutdown failed\"\n+  cp bazel-genfiles/timestamp first_timestamp || fail \"No output\"\n+  sleep 1 # Make sure we're on a different second to avoid false passes.\n+  bazel build //:rule || fail \"Build failed\"\n+  diff bazel-genfiles/timestamp first_timestamp || fail \"Output was built again\"\n+}\n+\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"bsilver8192","id":2999225,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTkyMjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2999225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192","html_url":"https://github.com/bsilver8192","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsilver8192/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/573/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}